{
  "title": "NetBird Overview",
  "description": "Peers of a NetBird account (connected, last seen, expired logins, OS, client versions) and its audit log.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "template_variables": [],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 2,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "",
        "background_color": "vivid_blue",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "definition": {
              "type": "note",
              "content": "**NetBird** connects devices, servers and cloud resources over a WireGuard® overlay network. This dashboard shows the peers of the connected NetBird account (connected or not, last seen, expired logins, client versions) and its audit log: who added or removed peers, changed policies, routes, DNS and networks, created setup keys or invited users.\n\nConnect an account in [Integrations → NetBird](/integrations/netbird): ObserveCraft reads its management API every minute, for NetBird Cloud and self-hosted NetBird alike.",
              "background_color": "white",
              "font_size": "14",
              "text_align": "left",
              "show_tick": false,
              "tick_pos": "50%",
              "tick_edge": "left",
              "has_padding": true
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "show_title": false,
        "banner_img": "/images/integrations/netbird-banner.svg"
      },
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 5
      }
    },
